1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Do you see AI as taking people's jobs?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:20,000
IT is safe. But AI will take few jobs like communication networks, servers.
AI makes mistakes — thousands. ChatGPT gives you 90% correct, but sometimes it gets you bad.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Do you trust AI for work? It depends how you use it.
If you use it for school to do for you, it works against you.
It's there to assist you, not to do it for you.

4
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:35,000
What must AI do for us to trust it fully like a phone?
Like we know phone works, petrol in phone?

5
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:50,000
For South Africa it's not easy because our things are not developing like other words.
Our crime rate is on top. So AI must help catch crime.

6
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:20,000
From push notifications. From transactions that are approved but fraud —
right through how it happens. The person has the app, has the web, has bank account,
he transfers himself. But he transfers after being scammed.

7
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Our model doesn't just look at transaction like other apps.
It looks at the sequence how you get to sending money to beneficiary.

8
00:05:40,000 --> 00:06:00,000
You get a call 5 minutes, after call, create beneficiary, then send R20,000.
Hold — something is wrong in that sequence.

9
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Normal user: checks balance, scrolls app, uses virtual card.
Fraud pattern: gets call, checks balance abnormally, then beneficiary enter + immediate send.

10
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Even gogos — mama, gogo — they get new story, first R2,000, then R4,000, then R8,000, then R10k.
One billion lost like that. Money exists. And even if we verify pictures before, still fraud.

11
00:10:30,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Windows analogy: Microsoft Word, Excel, Access, Teams — different but one house — Windows OS.
ProofBridge is same — one house (trust umbrella) that does many things.

12
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:20,000
ProofBridge works to close that — auditing, verifying that this thing really happened, with evidence.
Anyone can verify themselves. System you can buy.
